{
  "about": "Curriculum for the r-track (course). Units follow the topic titles of roadmap.sh/ai-engineer (snapshot 2026-10-12). Only the topic TITLES are used as a checklist. roadmap.sh text is copyrighted and must never be copied into reels, captions or this repo. Facts come from primary sources.",
  "rules": [
    "One unit can need more than one reel (reels_target). Each reel is stand-alone: one idea, terms defined inside it, no Part N.",
    "Teach the concept, not the vendor. Tool-specific topics (skipped_as_tool_specific) appear only when the concept needs a real example, checked against the official docs of that vendor.",
    "The planner picks the next unit in order whose status is todo or in_progress, skipping anything already in state/covered.json.",
    "A unit is done when its reels_target reels are built and published (status done)."
  ],
